      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you are using a newer Poiyomi shader, that is because it has to automatically \"Lock in\" all of the shaders before uploading. There is no progress bar when it does it automatically before upload, but there is a progress bar if you do it manually. Depending on how many materials you have, it can take 30 seconds to 5 minutes. Give it time.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
